      "section_type": "taxonomy",
      "original_text": "          Syn.     Cieutaria   aquatica Lam.     —    Coriandrum     Cicuta Roth.\n\n          Familie: Umbelliferae        Juss.     Unterfamilie:          Orthospermae        Juss.     Section:        Ammineae\nKoch.     Gattung: Cieua L.",
      "normalized_text": null,
      "zh_tw_rendering": "同義名：Cieutaria aquatica Lam. 科：Umbelliferae Juss. 亞科：Orthospermae Juss. 屬：Cieua L.",
